{"id":"44e153c5be050e52","group":"43","path":"43/43-thm-random-pseudo-jump-inversion.md","title":"随机点上的非平凡伪跳跃反演","display":"thm-random-pseudo-jump-inversion — 随机点上的非平凡伪跳跃反演","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-thm-random-pseudo-jump-inversion","aliases":["43-thm-random-pseudo-jump-inversion"],"display":"thm-random-pseudo-jump-inversion — 随机点上的非平凡伪跳跃反演","depends_on":["[[43-df-pseudo-jump]]","[[43-df-mlrandom]]","[[43-df-jump]]","[[43-df-turing-red]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28 (629 PDF pages)","source_location":"Theorem 11.14.1 (Nies)","source_printed_pages":"285","source_pdf_pages":"305","source_scope":"book","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_statement_checked":true,"source_proof_checked":false,"eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"revision_round":"2026-10-16-round3"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-thm-random-pseudo-jump-inversion"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-thm-random-pseudo-jump-inversion</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-random-pseudo-jump-inversion — 随机点上的非平凡伪跳跃反演"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"cd1d0a3ff6acce66\" href=\"?note=cd1d0a3ff6acce66\" title=\"43-df-pseudo-jump\">43-df-pseudo-jump</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0586e0fd0301d605\" href=\"?note=0586e0fd0301d605\" title=\"43-df-mlrandom\">43-df-mlrandom</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b3936ae4c5d2dc79\" href=\"?note=b3936ae4c5d2dc79\" title=\"43-df-jump\">43-df-jump</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0784d1de3a88cd94\" href=\"?note=0784d1de3a88cd94\" title=\"43-df-turing-red\">43-df-turing-red</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28 (629 PDF pages)"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Theorem 11.14.1 (Nies)"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"285"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"305"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"2026-10-16-round3"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(e\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{NontrivialPseudoJump}(e)\">\\(\\operatorname{NontrivialPseudoJump}(e)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V_e(A)=A\\oplus W_e^A\">\\(V_e(A)=A\\oplus W_e^A\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"cd1d0a3ff6acce66\" href=\"?note=cd1d0a3ff6acce66\" title=\"43-df-pseudo-jump\">43-df-pseudo-jump</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MLRandom}\">\\(\\mathrm{MLRandom}\\)</span>、跳跃与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\equiv_T\">\\(\\equiv_T\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"0586e0fd0301d605\" href=\"?note=0586e0fd0301d605\" title=\"43-df-mlrandom\">43-df-mlrandom</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"b3936ae4c5d2dc79\" href=\"?note=b3936ae4c5d2dc79\" title=\"43-df-jump\">43-df-jump</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"0784d1de3a88cd94\" href=\"?note=0784d1de3a88cd94\" title=\"43-df-turing-red\">43-df-turing-red</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists X\\in2^\\omega\\;(\\mathrm{MLRandom}(X)\\land V_e(X)\\equiv_T\\varnothing^{\\prime}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists X\\in2^\\omega\\;(\\mathrm{MLRandom}(X)\\land V_e(X)\\equiv_T\\varnothing^{\\prime}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>非平凡性要求对每个oracle严格上升，不能只在空oracle上非平凡。此版草稿在该节只陈述结果，未给独立证明且引用为占位问号；本原子明确保留“来源陈述已核对、证明未核对”的证据边界。</p>\n<p>来源：用户所供2007-07-28草稿，Theorem 11.14.1 (Nies)；印刷页285，PDF页305。本轮逐项核对来源陈述；未将来源完整证明标记为已核验。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-pseudo-jump","status":"resolved","id":"cd1d0a3ff6acce66","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-pseudo-jump]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-mlrandom","status":"resolved","id":"0586e0fd0301d605","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-mlrandom]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-jump","status":"resolved","id":"b3936ae4c5d2dc79","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-jump]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-turing-red","status":"resolved","id":"0784d1de3a88cd94","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-turing-red]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-pseudo-jump","status":"resolved","id":"cd1d0a3ff6acce66","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$e\\in\\mathbb N$ 且 $\\operatorname{NontrivialPseudoJump}(e)$；$V_e(A)=A\\oplus W_e^A$ 见 [[43-df-pseudo-jump]]，$\\mathrm{MLRandom}$、跳跃与 $\\equiv_T$ 见 [[43-df-mlrandom]]、[[43-df-jump]]、[[43-df-turing-red]]。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-mlrandom","status":"resolved","id":"0586e0fd0301d605","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$e\\in\\mathbb N$ 且 $\\operatorname{NontrivialPseudoJump}(e)$；$V_e(A)=A\\oplus W_e^A$ 见 [[43-df-pseudo-jump]]，$\\mathr